<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>lambda-bill: licenses of the included crates</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.45; }
pre { background: #f3f3f3; padding: 0.75rem; white-space: pre-wrap; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Licenses of the included crates</h1>
<p>lambda-bill is built from its own source and the Rust crates below. Each license text is printed once, with the crates that use it.</p>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<section id="{{id}}">
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} ({{crate.repository}}){{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
